      "text": "Nah, $SIVE is the most unusual $1B photonics company I've ever seen. \n\nJust for AI DCs alone:\n\n- Reference laser for $GFS SCALE (CPO/NPO/pluggable)\n- 7 pluggable engagements disclosed, with $JBL as primary ramp (with H1 2027 timeline)\n- ELS path with O-Net\n- ELS path with $POET",
