        "NVDA"
      ],
      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
      "text": "I wanted exposure to DDR2/DDR3 bottleneck ongoing and found ESMT (3006). \n\nA $2.5B MC fabless company with PSMC wafer allocation (esp. focused on DDR2). \n\nLast month's net income was: $109.5M (July month), which annualized is $1.31B net profit (1.9x runrate P/E). \n\nIf we look at https://t.co/M3cWxKJ4bw",
      "url": "https://twitter.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092789800428622128",
      "time": "2026-08-27 09:42",
      "cashtags": [],
      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$NVDA: \"We expect to grow revenue by approximately 70% in fiscal 2028. This is a supply constrained outlook\"\n\nThat statement alone is probably more important than the entire earnings beat just now? \n\nInsane upward revision beat from +43.9% expected to 70%. \n\n\"With cloud industry https://t.co/vjYbtuvg0j",
      "url": "https://twitter.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092723047107355133",
      "time": "2026-08-27 05:17",
      "cashtags": [
        "NVDA"
      ],
      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$NVDA earnings TLDR:\n\nRevenue: $96.22B vs. ~$92.17B (beat)\nAdj. EPS: $2.22 vs. $2.09-$2.10 (beat)\nDC: $89.0B vs. ~$86.3B (beat)\nAdj. gross margin: 75% vs. 75%\n\nHyperscaler Revenue: $48.71B from $43.05B last quarter (custom ASIC growth hasn't really prevented this revenue from",
