      "cashtags": [
        "NVDA"
      ],
      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
      "text": "I know everyone’s watching $NVDA earnings right now…\n\nBut did you know Landmark signed a 4 year CW agreement with US customer to ensure “sufficient supply”?\n\nSo now you have:\n\n- $LITE (capacity gone)\n- $COHR (capacity gone)\n- Landmark (capacity committed)\n- $AAOI (capacity for https://t.co/98qy5Oww5s",
      "url": "https://twitter.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092710854290764161",
      "time": "2026-08-27 04:28",
      "cashtags": [
        "AAOI",
        "COHR",
        "LITE",
        "NVDA"
      ],
      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
      "text": "The concept of “cascading bottlenecks” is just super cool.\n\nBecause of DDR4 supply shocks and costs:\n\nLot of ODMs are redesigning downward from DDR4 -&gt; DDR3 -&gt; DDR2.\n\nBut even the legacy players themselves like Winbond are withdrawing from DDR2.\n\nMaking the bottleneck even worse",
      "url": "https://twitter.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2092665229880836597",
      "time": "2026-08-27 01:27",
      "cashtags": [],
      "is_retweet": false
    },
    {
